{"v": 2, "id": "hj6xhzi", "form": "lernpfad", "design": {"pal": 1, "font": "schlicht", "shape": "eckig", "hero": "logo", "heroImg": ""}, "kicker": "Englisch · Jahrgangsstufe 6 · Beispiel", "title": "English Toolbox: Simple Past", "subtitle": "Alle Bausteine von PathFinder in Mini-Beispielen", "goals": ["alle Bausteine und Aufgabentypen von PathFinder kennenlernen", "das simple past erkennen und bilden"], "rank": "", "anim": {}, "typeLines": [], "stations": [{"id": "xfq3fwh", "title": "Lesen und Verstehen", "sub": "Text, Bild, Infokästen, Tabelle", "check": false, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "html": "Last Saturday Emma <b>visited</b> London with her family. They <b>took</b> the train and <b>saw</b> Big Ben.", "id": "8loetg2", "anim": "tippen"}, {"type": "image", "src": "data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20240%20160%22%3E%0A%20%20%3Crect%20width%3D%22240%22%20height%3D%22160%22%20rx%3D%2212%22%20fill%3D%22%23e7f1fb%22%2F%3E%0A%20%20%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%22200%22%20cy%3D%2234%22%20r%3D%2216%22%20fill%3D%22%23ffd45e%22%2F%3E%0A%20%20%3Crect%20x%3D%220%22%20y%3D%22128%22%20width%3D%22240%22%20height%3D%2232%22%20fill%3D%22%237cc38a%22%2F%3E%0A%20%20%3Crect%20x%3D%2298%22%20y%3D%2240%22%20width%3D%2244%22%20height%3D%2298%22%20fill%3D%22%23c99a5b%22%20stroke%3D%22%237a5630%22%20stroke-width%3D%222%22%2F%3E%0A%20%20%3Cpolygon%20points%3D%2296%2C40%20120%2C12%20144%2C40%22%20fill%3D%22%236b4b2a%22%2F%3E%0A%20%20%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%22120%22%20cy%3D%2262%22%20r%3D%2213%22%20fill%3D%22%23fff8e6%22%20stroke%3D%22%237a5630%22%20stroke-width%3D%222%22%2F%3E%0A%20%20%3Cline%20x1%3D%22120%22%20y1%3D%2262%22%20x2%3D%22120%22%20y2%3D%2253%22%20stroke%3D%22%23333%22%20stroke-width%3D%222%22%2F%3E%0A%20%20%3Cline%20x1%3D%22120%22%20y1%3D%2262%22%20x2%3D%22127%22%20y2%3D%2262%22%20stroke%3D%22%23333%22%20stroke-width%3D%222%22%3E%3CanimateTransform%20attributeName%3D%22transform%22%20type%3D%22rotate%22%20from%3D%220%20120%2062%22%20to%3D%22360%20120%2062%22%20dur%3D%226s%22%20repeatCount%3D%22indefinite%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fline%3E%0A%20%20%3Cg%20fill%3D%22%237a5630%22%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%22106%22%20y%3D%2286%22%20width%3D%228%22%20height%3D%2212%22%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%22126%22%20y%3D%2286%22%20width%3D%228%22%20height%3D%2212%22%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%22106%22%20y%3D%22108%22%20width%3D%228%22%20height%3D%2212%22%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%22126%22%20y%3D%22108%22%20width%3D%228%22%20height%3D%2212%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%0A%20%20%3Crect%20x%3D%2230%22%20y%3D%22100%22%20width%3D%2236%22%20height%3D%2228%22%20rx%3D%224%22%20fill%3D%22%23d9483b%22%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%2234%22%20y%3D%22104%22%20width%3D%2210%22%20height%3D%228%22%20fill%3D%22%23bfe3ff%22%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%2252%22%20y%3D%22104%22%20width%3D%2210%22%20height%3D%228%22%20fill%3D%22%23bfe3ff%22%2F%3E%0A%20%20%3Ctext%20x%3D%22120%22%20y%3D%22152%22%20font-family%3D%22sans-serif%22%20font-size%3D%2211%22%20text-anchor%3D%22middle%22%20fill%3D%22%23234%22%3ELondon%3C%2Ftext%3E%0A%3C%2Fsvg%3E", "alt": "Emma's trip to London", "caption": "Emma's trip to London", "size": "klein", "id": "708cl23"}, {"type": "info", "kind": "merke", "title": "", "html": "The simple past is for finished actions in the past: <i>yesterday, last week, two days ago</i>.", "img": "", "name": "", "id": "6wr6pce"}, {"type": "info", "kind": "regel", "title": "", "html": "Regular verbs: verb + <b>-ed</b> (play → played). Irregular verbs: learn them by heart (go → went).", "img": "", "name": "", "id": "x2cnztm"}, {"type": "info", "kind": "tipp", "title": "", "html": "Signal words help you: <i>yesterday, last …, … ago, in 2020</i>.", "img": "", "name": "", "id": "76s58p7"}, {"type": "info", "kind": "achtung", "title": "", "html": "After <b>did</b> or <b>didn't</b> the verb stays in the base form: <i>Did you go?</i> – not <i>Did you went?</i>", "img": "", "name": "", "id": "ef6uesk"}, {"type": "info", "kind": "begriff", "title": "irregular verb", "html": "A verb that does not form the past with -ed, e.g. <i>see → saw</i>.", "img": "", "name": "", "id": "31zlfyg"}, {"type": "info", "kind": "figur", "title": "", "html": "Wow, Emma was really busy in London!", "img": "data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20100%20100%22%3E%3Cellipse%20cx%3D%2246%22%20cy%3D%2288%22%20rx%3D%2226%22%20ry%3D%225%22%20fill%3D%22%23000%22%20opacity%3D%22.08%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M46%2026c21%200%2032%2015%2032%2033s-10%2028-32%2028-32-10-32-28%2011-33%2032-33z%22%20fill%3D%22%239B8AFB%22%20stroke%3D%22%233d2a73%22%20stroke-width%3D%223.5%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M30%2070c4%209%2028%209%2032%200%22%20fill%3D%22%23C9C0FF%22%20opacity%3D%22.7%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M30%2030q-4-9%202-12M60%2030q4-9-2-12%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke%3D%22%233d2a73%22%20stroke-width%3D%223.5%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22round%22%2F%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%2232%22%20cy%3D%2218%22%20r%3D%223.5%22%20fill%3D%22%23FFD54A%22%20stroke%3D%22%233d2a73%22%20stroke-width%3D%222.5%22%2F%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%2258%22%20cy%3D%2218%22%20r%3D%223.5%22%20fill%3D%22%23FFD54A%22%20stroke%3D%22%233d2a73%22%20stroke-width%3D%222.5%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M29%2055q7-8%2014%200M49%2055q7-8%2014%200%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke%3D%22%233d2a73%22%20stroke-width%3D%223.5%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22round%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M34%2064q12%2017%2024%200z%22%20fill%3D%22%236B2E5E%22%20stroke%3D%22%233d2a73%22%20stroke-width%3D%223%22%20stroke-linejoin%3D%22round%22%2F%3E%3Cellipse%20cx%3D%2225%22%20cy%3D%2264%22%20rx%3D%224.5%22%20ry%3D%222.8%22%20fill%3D%22%23F49AC1%22%2F%3E%3Cellipse%20cx%3D%2267%22%20cy%3D%2264%22%20rx%3D%224.5%22%20ry%3D%222.8%22%20fill%3D%22%23F49AC1%22%2F%3E%3Cg%20transform%3D%22translate%2882%2022%29%22%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M0-16a12%2012%200%200%201%207%2022v4h-14v-4A12%2012%200%200%201%200-16z%22%20fill%3D%22%23FFF3A6%22%20stroke%3D%22%233d2a73%22%20stroke-width%3D%223%22%20stroke-linejoin%3D%22round%22%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%22-6%22%20y%3D%2210%22%20width%3D%2212%22%20height%3D%225%22%20rx%3D%222%22%20fill%3D%22%23B9B4C7%22%20stroke%3D%22%233d2a73%22%20stroke-width%3D%222.5%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M64%2010l-4-3M99%2020l-5%200M97%205l-4%203%22%20stroke%3D%22%23F4B731%22%20stroke-width%3D%223%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22round%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E", "name": "Pfadi", "id": "nlx6ov0"}, {"type": "table", "head": true, "rows": [["base form", "simple past"], ["go", "went"], ["see", "saw"], ["take", "took"]], "id": "aa5bv1s"}, {"type": "reveal", "summary": "Did you know?", "html": "Big Ben is the name of the big bell – not of the tower.", "id": "fof6dkw"}]}, {"id": "8acg8jo", "title": "Wörter und Formen", "sub": "Markieren, Sortieren, Zuordnen", "check": false, "blocks": [{"type": "mark", "title": "Mark all verbs in the simple past.", "html": "Yesterday Emma {{woke}} up early. She {{had}} breakfast and {{walked}} to the station. Today she is tired and wants to sleep.", "xp": 10, "id": "l5ne6az"}, {"type": "sort", "title": "Sort the verbs.", "groups": [{"name": "regular verbs", "items": ["played", "visited", "walked"]}, {"name": "irregular verbs", "items": ["went", "saw", "took"]}], "xp": 10, "id": "jh314u6"}, {"type": "match", "title": "Match the base form and the simple past.", "pairs": [{"a": "go", "b": "went", "ka": "4kzjqgny87", "kb": "q0pgo7fz7s"}, {"a": "see", "b": "saw", "ka": "zyboq4zh7x", "kb": "crk1xy1v37"}, {"a": "buy", "b": "bought", "ka": "qgh0i44k01", "kb": "l45vmhadwq"}, {"a": "eat", "b": "ate", "ka": "5xjcz57kma", "kb": "ohuy6v83xf"}], "xp": 10, "id": "pbmtjje"}]}, {"id": "37wo7ls", "title": "Sätze bauen", "sub": "Lückentext, Satzpuzzle, Reihenfolge", "check": false, "blocks": [{"type": "gap", "title": "Fill in the simple past.", "sub": "", "html": "Yesterday I [[watched]] (watch) a film. Then we [[went]] (go) for a pizza.", "bank": false, "extra": [], "heft": false, "xp": 10, "id": "akciq3l"}, {"type": "gap", "title": "Choose the right word.", "sub": "", "html": "Emma [[visited]] London last year. She [[didn't]] see the King.", "bank": true, "extra": ["visits", "don't"], "heft": false, "xp": 10, "id": "4v0l5eh"}, {"type": "order", "words": true, "title": "Put the words in the right order.", "items": ["did", "you", "visit", "London", "last summer"], "alts": [["last summer", "did", "you", "visit", "London"]], "xp": 10, "id": "rur3f7r"}, {"type": "order", "words": false, "title": "Put Emma's day in the right order.", "items": ["In the morning Emma took the train to London.", "At noon she saw Big Ben.", "In the afternoon she visited a museum.", "In the evening she went back home."], "alts": [], "xp": 10, "id": "0r4yix1"}]}, {"id": "ur6m3zb", "title": "Zeig, was du kannst", "sub": "Quiz, Aufgabe, Sperre", "check": false, "blocks": [{"type": "quiz", "qs": [{"q": "Which sentence is correct?", "opts": [{"t": "She went home.", "ok": true, "fb": "Right: go → went.", "k": "oe64rsq8nq"}, {"t": "She goed home.", "ok": false, "fb": "Careful: go is an irregular verb.", "k": "fxhypk4q3i"}, {"t": "She go home yesterday.", "ok": false, "fb": "You need the past form here.", "k": "1vjd0yh99n"}]}, {"q": "What is the simple past of <i>buy</i>?", "opts": [{"t": "buyed", "ok": false, "fb": "buy is irregular.", "k": "qhlerhly5o"}, {"t": "bought", "ok": true, "fb": "Yes!", "k": "hj2jz7l8pc"}, {"t": "brought", "ok": false, "fb": "That is the past of <i>bring</i>.", "k": "nfgrh4qjbo"}]}], "xp": 10, "id": "rywp6xt"}, {"type": "task", "title": "Your turn", "html": "Write the simple past of <b>take</b>.", "xp": 20, "tips": ["It rhymes with <i>book</i>."], "solution": "take → took", "img": "", "answer": "took", "solHide": true, "id": "9gueglf"}, {"type": "lock", "after": "9gueglf", "id": "4e4g8ao"}, {"type": "info", "kind": "abschluss", "title": "", "html": "Great job – you know all task types now! In a digital test (Art: Prüfung) there is one more type: <b>Freitext</b>, an open answer that your teacher marks.", "img": "", "name": "", "id": "5up1niu"}]}, {"id": "l48j0hx", "title": "Für andere Fächer", "sub": "Code und UML", "check": false, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "html": "Diese Bausteine braucht man eher in Informatik – hier nur zum Anschauen.", "id": "17r1hge"}, {"type": "code", "lang": "python", "code": "print(\"Hello, London!\")", "id": "pyo0kvj"}, {"type": "uml", "name": "Tourist", "attrs": ["name: String", "city: String"], "methods": ["visit(place: String)", "takePhoto()"], "id": "lmgkgop"}]}], "cert": {"on": true, "need": "immer", "pct": 80, "text": "hat den Lernpfad mit folgendem Ergebnis bearbeitet:", "show": {"zeit": true, "tipps": true, "quiz": true, "xp": true}}}